                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I had such high hope for this game. \nWatching Fooster play this game, a few years ago, I tried it out for myself a few years ago by now, just to see, what it was about.\nThe first bit was so good! The intro and the first part of the game, had such potential.\nBut then the dialog and the pacing of the game emerged and not only was it really rushed, but also the dialog and voice acting wasn't good. \nIt made me more irritated then it was enjoyable. \nThe story line isn't much of a story line, and it is really rushed what is there. \nThe gameplay wasn't good either, it was very clungy especially when you were fighting, again, very rushed. \nThe graphics are good, but that's about it.\nI really wish I could give this game a positiv review, but as of is, not a chance, unfortunately.",
